  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shiraka Training Programme Trade Promotion and Economic Diplomacy 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This annual course aims to help civil servants and relevant semi-public organisations working on economic diplomacy to share their knowledge and skills, enabling them to lead and inspire the modernisation of trade promotion in their home countries. The course also aims to strengthen participants&apos; ties with the Netherlands and stakeholders in the Dutch trade promotion sector.</narrative>
  </description>
